---
title: Button Event Counter - FreeRTOS Notifications
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant BTN as Button Task (producer)
    participant CNT as Counter Task (consumer)
    participant LED as LEDs

    loop every 10 ms
        BTN->>BTN: PressDetector_Update()
        alt press edge
            BTN->>CNT: xTaskNotify(NOTIFY_PRESS)
        else long-press
            BTN->>CNT: xTaskNotify(NOTIFY_LONG_PRESS)
        end
    end

    loop forever
        CNT->>CNT: xTaskNotifyWait(timeout 10 ms)
        alt notification received
            CNT->>CNT: press -> increment / long-press -> reset
        end
        CNT->>LED: CounterDisplay_Show(pressed, count)
    end